595	function createClaudeMd(): void {
596	  logStep('📝', 'Setting up CLAUDE.md integration...');
597	  
598	  const claudeSection = `<!-- zzZMCPToolsTypescriptzz START -->
599	# ZMCPTools Agent Operations Guide
600	
601	This guide provides actionable workflows for Claude agents using the ZMCPTools MCP toolset for autonomous development.
602	
603	## 🧠 Agent Decision Framework
604	
605	### When to Use Multi-Agent Orchestration
606	**ALWAYS use \`orchestrate_objective()\` for:**
607	- Tasks requiring 3+ sequential steps
608	- Full-stack implementations (backend + frontend + tests)
609	- Complex features requiring multiple specializations
610	- Documentation scraping + implementation workflows
611	- Development environment setup + testing
612	
613	**Use single-agent tools for:**
614	- Simple file operations
615	- Quick analysis or investigation
616	- Single-purpose tasks under 30 minutes
617	
618	### Foundation Caching Strategy
619	**Critical for cost optimization:**
